v1.2.3 round-65 (2026.11.21): ENGINE UPGRADE — bundled binary moved to Stockfish 19 arm64-universal.
  - Version: versionCode=10203, versionName="1.2.3" (unchanged).
  - The engine shipped at build time into src/main/jniLibs/ (this
    directory's build-time destination) is now the official sf_19
    `stockfish-android-arm64-universal` (80,233,187-byte tar.gz;
    the sf_19 release no longer ships a dedicated armv8-dotprod tar —
    since sf_17 the Android arm64 asset is a universal build that
    detects dotprod and other CPU features at runtime).
  - New identity, verified before use (ELF 64-bit ARM aarch64,
    statically linked, for Android 29, NDK r27c 12479018):
    100,695,968 bytes, SHA-256
    ffd8fc2004d3d19f9fdab95d84c92709aea92e8d3af405eda0b281b23cf1daf8.
    (Prior sf_18 armv8-dotprod: 114,115,752 bytes, SHA-256
    8f7116d3f1a7004a6581d4fb0c1ff891ce095bab6d45e52f1578897cf23b61b5 —
    historical values preserved in the round-by-round entries below.)
  - Cross-file consistency of the new digest/size is guarded by the v3
    sentinel V3-40 (Java EXPECTED_ENGINE_SHA256 == NOTICE == BUILDING.md
    topmost notes; progress denominator == NOTICE byte size).
  - License classification: unchanged — Stockfish engine binary, GPL v3.

